## The $113,883 Lab Arbitrage Window

**The $113,883 gap between natural and lab at 4ct is the biggest absolute-dollar arbitrage window on the marquise chart.** It is bigger than the $50,868 gap at 3ct, bigger than the $25,084 gap at 2.5ct, bigger than any single marquise tier below 4ct. The reason is simple — natural 4ct prices scale faster than lab 4ct prices as you move up carat.

